Cell["\<\
(*1.Ysing Mathematica, solve the following differential equation by \
completing the following steps . 2 \|01d466\[Prime]\[Prime] + 5 \|01d466\
\[Prime] + 2 \|01d466 = \|01d465 + 1 \|01d4522\|01d465
a . Find \|01d466 by using the Solve functionality of Mathematica . \|01d450
b . Find the Wronskian (W), W1, and W2 for the differential equation using \
matrices . c . Integrate to find the \|01d466 solution . Use Expand to make \
it simplify as much as possible . d . Use DSolve to verify your solution . \
Use Expand to make it simplify as much as possible .*)\
\>", "Subitem",
